------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Origin and attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TrainTrail is a modified version of AirTrail, a self-hosted flight tracker
created by Johan Ohly and the AirTrail contributors, and released under the
GNU General Public License, version 3.

  Original project:  https://github.com/johanohly/AirTrail
  Based on:          commit ed100a90cd31bc583ca567ddf636a2fcfb408858
                     (release v3.13.1, 2026-10-24)
  First modified:    2026-10-27

What changed: the flight-tracking domain was replaced with rail travel
(stations, operators, trains and journeys instead of airports, airlines,
aircraft and flights), and the project was renamed.

The copyright of the original authors in the code that remains from AirTrail is
retained. Nothing in this file removes, replaces or limits it.

